    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Email enquiries only. \r\n\r\nA well-presented three-bedroom home, ideally positioned in the heart of Churchtown.\r\n\r\nNestled within a small, quiet and mature development just off Whitehall Road, this property has been recently upgraded to include repainting and new flooring.  The well-appointed accommodation comprises an entrance hallway leading to a well-laid-out kitchen with ample storage, with a bay window to the front of the house. The living and dining area to the rear open onto the la private, south-facing garden, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor living experience. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation includes a main bedroom with an en-suite, a second double bedroom and a single room. All bedrooms benefit from built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage. A main bathroom completes the accommodation. \r\n\r\nTo the front, the driveway provides off-street parking. Further features include gas-fired central heating, a C BER rating, and an exceptional location. \r\n\r\nSet in the leafy, tranquil suburb of Churchtown, the location is second to none — within walking distance of Nutgrove Shopping Centre and the vibrant Churchtown Village, with its various cafés, restaurants, and local shops. \r\n\r\nEmail enquiries only. Please include full details when enquiring. Due to the high level of interest, it may not be possible to respond to all enquiries"
      },
      {
